'''Madoka Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 294
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Madoka Cat
|name2 = Magical Girl Madoka Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Magical Girl Madoka Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This Cat is essentially an attempt to create an anti-Floating debuffer. However, [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] completely outclasses Madoka, especially when [[Talents|Talented]].

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

